File:Boss_Raglich_Spritesheet.png
File:Boss_Raglich_Spritesheet_2.png
</gallery>
{{#ev:youtube|0Y8R0FTOs24}}

* '''Cadavra''', a pair of bosses similar in appearance to {{e|Chimera}}. Their walking animation gifs were first shown by [[Edmund McMillen]] on September 4, 2020,<ref>https://twitter.com/edmundmcmillen/status/1302048115504021507</ref> but they were never found in the DLC's final release. Unlike the previous two bosses, Cadavra does not exist as an entity and cannot be spawned in-game. It does not have a portrait nor a boss title. Edmund stated that they're "still in pieces maybe one day",<ref>https://twitter.com/edmundmcmillen/status/1377712528902459395</ref> implying that Cadavra would be later added in the future update patches some other time.

