=== Cut Monsters ===
Some monsters from the ''Antibirth'' mod are found in the game files but unused, while others are completely absent in ''Repentance''. Edmund McMillen confirmed that he has [https://twitter.com/edmundmcmillen/status/1486234569758035973 no plans for the currently unused Antibirth monsters].
* It is possible to encounter these enemies along with other cut enemies with {{i|TMTRAINER}} or in the [[DELETE THIS]] challenge, although it is highly unlikely.<ref>https://www.reddit.com/r/bindingofisaac/comments/nafk69/what_enemy_is_this/</ref><ref>https://imgur.com/uNmBHzk</ref>

Unused monsters:

* '''[[anti:Fatty#Barfy|Barfy]]''' - A variant of [[Fatty]]. Wanders around the room, and slowly follows Isaac when he's in its line of sight. Occasionally spews clusters of green shots that leaves green creep towards Isaac.
* '''[[anti:One Tooth#Blind Bat|Blind Bat]]''' - A variant of [[One Tooth]]. Starts out asleep. When Isaac gets close, it wakes up and chases Isaac, followed by a group of three more Blind Bats.
* '''[[anti:One Tooth#Echo Bat|Echo Bat]]''' - A variant of One Tooth. Flies towards Isaac and periodically fires three white orbs. If an orb hits Isaac, he becomes confused and his movement is reversed for a few seconds.
* '''[[anti:Corpse Eater|Corpse Eater]]''' - Rapidly moves around the room erratically and charges at Isaac if he comes within its line of sight. When spawned in game, it will behave like normal but only has the front end for its sprite.
* '''[[anti:Corpse Eater#Carrion Rider|Carrion Rider]]''' - A variant of Corpse Eater. Rapidly moves around the room erratically and charges at Isaac if he comes within its line of sight. The Bony on its back shoots at Isaac. If spawned in game, acts the same as Corpse Eater, while also having a chance to spawn a charger on death.
* '''[[anti:Necromancer|Necromancer]]''' - Summons skeleton enemies such as Bonies and Big Bonies.
* '''[[anti:Nightwatch|Nightwatch]]''' - Invulnerable enemies. Moves in a fixed pattern or rotates in a spot. If Isaac enters its light, it will lock all doors, summon enemies, and vanish.
* '''[[anti:Baby|Swapper]]''' - A variant of [[Baby]]. Slowly floats towards Isaac and fires purple lasers. Occasionally teleports and reappears elsewhere. Has a chance to swap positions with Isaac.
* '''[[anti:Strifer|Strifer]]''' - Walks horizontally or vertically, attempting to line up with Isaac. Frequently fires lines of four tears forwards.
* '''[[anti:Fatty#Vessel|Vessel]]''' - A variant of Fatty. Walks around the room and explodes into Small Maggots upon death.

