| Poisons all enemies in the room for 48 hits. Seems to deal between 1.0 and 3.5 damage per hit, but never scales off of Isaac's damage stat.
|-
| '''Rune of Othala'''
| [[File:Cut Rune Othala Icon.png]]
| Gives Isaac a random item that he already has. Items interact like how they would if you had gotten them from a pedestal.
|-
| '''Rune of Gebo'''
| [[File:Cut Rune Gebo Icon.png]]
| Interacts with any machine or Beggar in the room. Donates 7 coins to Donation Machines, plays Beggars 6 times, plays Blood Donation Machines 4 times, plays other machines 5 times. Machines and Beggars have an increased chance to pay out or explode, even paying out at only one play.
|-
| '''Rune of Fehu'''
| [[File:Cut Rune Fehu Icon.png]]
| Turns all pickups or items in the room into coins. Coins generated are equal to how much the item would be worth in a shop (Items give 15 cents, trinkets give 5 cents, Black Hearts give 6 cents, 1+1 Bombs/Keys give 10 cents). Does not work on Chests, open or closed, unless the chest has a pedestal item. Does not work with pickups or items not on the ground (Shop items, Devil deals).
* This effect has been implemented in the form of {{P|IX - The Hermit?|n}} inverted tarot card.
|-
| '''Immortal Hearts'''
| [[File:Cut Immortal Heart.png|40px]]
| Take two hits to be fully depleted and will regenerate from half to full upon clearing a room.
|-
